18. Confirm the game actually contains 15 launch lessons.
19. Confirm the progression data actually contains the correct boss/minion structure.
20. Confirm completed progression is GREEN, current progression is YELLOW, and locked progression is GREY.

If any of these tests fail, investigate the underlying cause and fix it before considering the task complete.

DO NOT tell me that something was implemented merely because the UI looks different.

The actual progression logic, data, routing, lesson content, minion count, boss count, and completion states must all be correct.
